(24-Hour Urinary Sodium and Potassium Excretion and Cardiovascular Risk) Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
14 TL
() Tj T*
(Ma Y, He FJ, Sun Q, Yuan C, Kieneker LM, Curhan GC, MacGregor GA, Bakker SJL, Campbell NRC, ) Tj T*
(Wang M, Rimm EB, Manson JE, Willett WC, Hofman A, Gansevoort RT, Cook NR, Hu FB. New England ) Tj T*
(Journal of Medicine. 2022 Jan 20; 386\(3\):252-263. DOI: 10.1056/NEJMoa2109794   PMID: 34767706) Tj T*
